cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you wish to cite the "r-project-template" repository use:'
type: software
license: BSD 3-Clause
title: r-project-template
version: 0.5.1
abstract: >-
  A template for R projects that is not an R package, exploring recent tools
  from the R ecosystem: box for modular code organization instead of package
  namespaces, uvr for R version installation and dependency management, air for
  formatting, and jarl for linting. Includes a justfile, testthat testing, git
  hooks via prek, GitHub Actions CI, and automated semantic releases.
